    "summary": "This rectangular textile is composed of a fine, translucent ground fabric with a scattered pattern of small embroidered floral sprigs. Along the lower edge is a continuous band of oval medallions framed by embroidered scrolling elements, each enclosing a central floral motif executed in <em>calado</em> or another openwork technique. Vertical floral panels separate the medallions, and the edge terminates in a scalloped openwork border.",
